{
  "name": "dsh-update-guard",
  "version": "1.1.0",
  "private": false,
  "type": "module",
  "description": "更新闸：插件自动更新的护栏——改过源码的插件禁直接自动装（补丁一上本地改动全没）：git在管且无未存档改动才放行；未存档改动先commit或备份；装后回读版本对账。update_guard工具本地判定可否安全更新，零依赖零构建；v1.1新增匿名心跳（只发插件名/版本/随机id·每24h一次·失败静默·把\"装了\"变成\"在用\"读数）。",
  "license": "MIT",
  "main": "./index.js",
  "exports": {
    ".": "./index.js",
    "./locale/*.json": "./locale/*.json",
    "./icon": "./icon.svg"
  },
  "files": [
    "index.js",
    "cordis.patch.yml",
    "locale/*.json",
    "icon.svg",
    "README.md"
  ],
  "keywords": [
    "dsh",
    "dsh-plugin",
    "deepseek-harness",
    "agent",
    "ai-agent",
    "auto-update",
    "safety"
  ],
  "dsh": {
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    }
  },
  "peerDependencies": {
    "@antinomyhq/forge": "*"
  }
}